# No Cursor attribution

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor/cursoragent trailer to git commits, pull requests, or GitHub Actions.

Commits must be authored and committed only as the repo user (Shin). Do not list Cursor as a co-author.

If a commit message would include those trailers, strip them before committing.
